{"ref":"BDB, שֶׁ֫מַע²","hw":"שֶׁ֫מַע²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁ֫מַע</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> usually Σαμα(α), Σεμαα <strong>(</strong>cf. Sab. n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">סמע</span> Hal<sup>509</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  in Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:44\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.44\">1 Ch 2:44</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁ֑מַע</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.43\">43</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  in Reuben <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.8\">5:8</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  in Benj. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.13\">8:13</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁמְעִי</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.21\">21</a>).<br><strong>4.</strong>  post-ex. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.4\">Ne 8:4</a>, Σαμαιας.","next":"BDB, שֵׁ֫מַע","prev":"BDB, שֶׁ֫מַע"}